%% Free-form question path: route -> conversation -> verifier
sequenceDiagram
  actor Citizen
  participant Chat as Web Chat
  participant API as POST /chat
  participant Router as route()
  participant Conversation as classify / answer_question
  participant Clauses as Committed clauses
  participant Verifier
  Citizen->>Chat: Ask “What documents do I need?”
  Chat->>API: English or localized message
  API->>Router: Route canonical query
  Router-->>API: Supported scheme domain
  API->>Conversation: Classify message intent
  Conversation->>Clauses: Pass all PMFME clause facts
  Clauses-->>Conversation: Plain facts + clause ids
  Conversation->>Verifier: Check answer against selected citations
  Verifier-->>Conversation: Verified answer or unknown
  Conversation-->>API: Reply + reply_citations
  API-->>Chat: Reply then next question if needed
